="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116417538098798&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1aZdqBeEtJ" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2d08009a66a5e86eba92136e420e77e292909f2c.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;晴天骤雨落，冒雨收柴火，林间采木耳，土中挖山药，竹子做桌椅，棕树取淀粉，牛蛙一锅炖。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aZdqBeEtJ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1aZdqBeEtJ</guid><pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>《荒野食神》武陵篇5</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116405827666164&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1BYQLBqEVu" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ca9454a1f74e1d62dc8a8176caa5de047268530d.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;湖北瞰景归，后天启新途，一个多月后见。《荒野食神》武陵篇5：党参菖蒲黄精全。扎营安寨风相伴，火灭重燃钻木烟。慢烹鲜蛙加麻椒，自在逍遥胜神仙。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1BYQLBqEVu</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1BYQLBqEVu</guid><pubDate>Wed, 15 Apr 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>《荒野食神》武陵篇4</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116384923126853&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1b5QMBiE2q" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/44df7612f8b3831e6c6a7e7182ecdb56d816251c.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;进山先采野棉花，抬眼望山辨金芽，寻金古法传万家，棕树剖开取芯渣，捶揉淘淀出粉花，野棉配粉和面粑，荒野炊香乐无涯。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b5QMBiE2q</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b5QMBiE2q</guid><pubDate>Sat, 11 Apr 2026 09:40:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>《荒野食神》武陵篇3</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116371920913466&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1tGDnBYESR" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/fd256d07d2844b5c9729e3f14e66303059876a03.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;第三章溪间寻鱼，草木成酸：隔夜老鳖当早餐，松油艾草制火燃。徒步十里寻山鲜，虎杖酸香竹笋甜。扎营歇脚麻柳边，围坝晕鱼起波澜。一锅酸菜山野味，荒野求生赛神仙。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tGDnBYESR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tGDnBYESR</guid><pubDate>Thu, 09 Apr 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>《荒野食神》武陵篇2</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116362206775027&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1LBDaB5EdS" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cf8176764d56f52e190aa24d7bb957b636ef95b9.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;开始稳定，两天一更。速降下谷底，拾竹备材料。冒雨向前行，扎寨把营安，装备样样全，钓鳖做美餐！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LBDaB5EdS</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LBDaB5EdS</guid><pubDate>Tue, 07 Apr 2026 09:40:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>《荒野食神》武陵篇1</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116327830325834&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1LV9LBMEb2" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e9ff128ccb1401da2403055d289031defc452d12.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;告别极简苦行，装备拉满，地形熟门，重返武陵，《荒野食神》正式开灶。拍摄刚归，整理素材剪辑，7天左右稳定更新。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LV9LBMEb2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LV9LBMEb2</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（30）</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116307781554082&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV15HX1BnENU" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c8ef0c4b07bf2e1afc1f954960ecd23818b24aa8.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;完结篇，下次再见。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15HX1BnENU</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV15HX1BnENU</guid><pubDate>Sun, 29 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item><item><title>乱星海 海岛求生（29）</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116304778365661&amp;amp;cid=undefined&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ToXGB7Etn" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/39b9b96700ef6b5bc6672854bd16ff66072ba0d4.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt;环岛归来收获丰。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ToXGB7Etn</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ToXGB7Etn</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>户外胡三浪</author></item></channel></rss>